Subject: [PATCH] codec2: Honor device ION cache flags outside APEX
Target-repository: frameworks/av
Base-commit: a8732aa05d8920fdbcc56638e5c63036227a5bb9
Path-prefix: a/ and b/ relative to the target repository root

The existing APEX component store reads the device ION cache policy, but
the non-APEX allocator path forces uncached flags. MSM8660 system ION heap
rejects CPU mappings of uncached buffers, leaving SoundPool decode workers
blocked and camera onPause waiting in SoundPool.release.

Read ro.com.android.media.swcodec.ion.flags with the same default 0 in the
non-APEX setter. Existing APEX logic, heap selection and alignment are
unchanged. Devices without the property retain allocFlags=0.

Device requirement: batman_lgu system.prop sets
ro.com.android.media.swcodec.ion.flags=1 (ION_FLAG_CACHED).
Rebuild/install system libcodec2_vndk and reboot to load the read-only
property. The APEX implementation already reads this property.
Dependencies: independent of 0002 (different source file). Both apply to
the same frameworks/av base; preserve the thumbnail patch when applying.
No SoundPool timeout, disabled sound, C2 disablement or heap-layout change.
Validation: three SoundPool load/play/release cycles (release 8-15 ms),
three camera captures/exits, C2 Vorbis/AAC/AVC decoding, and existing
high-resolution thumbnails/Qualcomm Surface decoding under Enforcing.

Apply manually from the Android source root:
  git -C frameworks/av apply --check "$PWD/device/lge/batman_lgu/patches/0004-codec2-honor-device-ION-cache-flags-outside-APEX.patch"
  git -C frameworks/av apply "$PWD/device/lge/batman_lgu/patches/0004-codec2-honor-device-ION-cache-flags-outside-APEX.patch"
Before applying, a successful reverse check means it is already present:
  git -C frameworks/av apply --reverse --check "$PWD/device/lge/batman_lgu/patches/0004-codec2-honor-device-ION-cache-flags-outside-APEX.patch"

diff --git a/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp b/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
index d16527ee6ff2b683dcd5e2131c3bdd8a2670ad58..5ac8239029380dd2ac7551b8b619649efa0f1e09 100644
--- a/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
+++ b/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
@@ -676,7 +676,9 @@ private:
                     me.set().minAlignment = defaultAlign;
 #else
                     me.set().heapMask = ~0;
-                    me.set().allocFlags = 0;
+                    // Match the software store's device-specific ION cache policy.
+                    me.set().allocFlags = property_get_int32(
+                            "ro.com.android.media.swcodec.ion.flags", 0);
                     me.set().minAlignment = 0;
 #endif
                     return C2R::Ok();
